 of said act! Experience the first part of the story, discover the stories of the clients and solve the mysteries of Salamanca. 🧸​ NEW PLUSHIESWe have new plushie designs and details!Choose between more designs and customize plushies ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691450","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1842846814446886","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"Join the Official Discord Server!","summary":"Big announcement time!We’ve been busy last week creating a Discord server for our community and, at last, here it is! You can join now!: Discord ServerThis is the studio server, so maybe, in the future, you’ll find new channels for our upcoming titles. Who knows what the future will have in mind for all of us! As for the present times, you’ll find 3 different category chats: ☺️ Info: where we’ll share our social media posts, as well as a link to all of them and official game announcements. 🗨️ Co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T15:01:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446886","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1840944183777021","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"We're going to gamescom 2026!!","summary":"Hello everyone!We’ve got a BIG ANNOUNCEMENT here, which you've already read on the title of this post, but let’s pretend you didn’t. Okay? Here we go. WE’RE GOING TO GAMESCOM 2026!!We will be attending the event from 26-30 August 2026 in Cologne, Germany and our booth will be located at the HOME of INDIES area, in Hall 10.2, E010g-D011g, where you’ll be able to play the updated demo and have a chat with us!If you go to the event, we hope to see you there! And, if not, you can still play the upda","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T15:00:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183777021","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1840310314343055","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev talk with Uprising and Toymaker : Threads of Joy now!","summary":"Live Event! Dev talk with Uprising and Toymaker : Threads of Joy/ The event went great, thank you all for coming. We're going to leave the broadcast looping during the Tiny Teams and Wholesome Celebration events! /","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T20:15:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314343055","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1839676055897595","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"Updated Demo, Steam Broadcast and more!","summary":"Hello everyone!We have so many things to tell you, so let’s start with…🔍​ Updated DEMO!:Change the size of the details in order to make them larger or smaller! After testing it a lot, we’ve finally added it to the demo that you will be able to play on August 6th!❤️‍🔥​ Steam Events!:We’re so proud to inform you that we’ve been selected for TWO Steam events that are going to happen at the same time, both from August 6th to August 13th.Those events are Wholesome Games Celebration and Tiny Teams! We","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T15:04:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055897595","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1839041357030197","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"Change the size of details, progress on ACT I and MORE!","summary":"Hello everyone! It's time we tell you some news about some of the things that we’ve been working on since the last update post.Starting with a new mechanic that you’ll certainly love:🔧 More customization!You’ll be able to change the size of the details! You'll be able to make them bigger and smaller! This way you have even more freedom to customize your plushies the way you want! This is something many people wanted us to add, and it was a really good idea. So we've worked on it and it'll be ava","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T16:57:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357030197","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1835871199315173","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"Toymaker: Threads of Joy is being featured by Cozy Jobs Simulators!","summary":"Our game is being featured by Cozy Jobs Simulators, along with many other titles!You can play the demo right now and craft as many plushies as you want! We updated it last week and added new content, so go and discover what’s new!: We have another big announcement coming soon, so stay tuned!And don’t forget to wishlist Toymaker: Threads of Joy!See you soon, Toymaker!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T10:34:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199315173","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1834602721201572","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"Updated Demo for Toymaker: Threads of Joy!","summary":"Long time no see! We’ve been working hard since the last announcement back in april in order to bring you an updated demo with some bug fixes, QoL improvements and the addition of spanish as an official language! Thanks to all the people that helped us with the feedback!Here are some of the changes that you can experience right now when playing the updated demo:Permanent improvements and QoL features:🧸 ​New plushies! Go and try them!🏍️​ General improvements to the game’s performance.💂 Proofread ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T12:04:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721201572","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1829528821318232","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"Toymaker: Threads of Joy joins the Backed by Backers Festival! Play the demo now","summary":"The kickstarter campaign for Toymaker: Threads of Joy enters its last 3 days. The campaign has been a great success, with more than 200% funded! You can help us with the project, earn digital and physical rewards, but also be a part of the game, helping us design a character, a customer or even have your pet in the game as a plushie!https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/uprisingstudios/toymaker-craft-plushies-and-discover-a-magical-storyIn addition to that we've been selected to participate in th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-14T16:00:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821318232","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1826992588604367","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"The Kickstarter campaign of Toymaker: Threads of Joy is now live + New trailer!","summary":"We are very excited to share that Toymaker: Threads of Joy is now live on Kickstarter and we’re celebrating it with a new trailer! This is a very important moment for us because this will give us the last push we need to finish the game with the level of quality and polish we strive for and you deserve.That’s why, if you like what you have seen of the game so far and what you’ve played on Steam, we encourage you to support us through the crowdfunding campaign. You can snatch some limited content","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-17T16:05:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588604367","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1825093633188199","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"The DEMO of Toymaker: Threads of Joy 🪡 is now available!","summary":"We are very excited to announce that our first public demo is now available on Steam! We hope you love it as you’ll get a good grasp of what makes Toymaker: Threads of Joy so cozy and enjoyable🪡🧸!The demo starts at the beginning of the game, and in it you’ll be able to explore the core mechanics of Toymaker while getting a small taste of its story based on a folk legend. Craft adorable toys, unlock new patterns, buy materials, try out different accessories and customizations for your plushies, n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-20T15:47:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633188199","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1825093633183182","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"Toymaker receives the Projects We Love badge from Kickstarter 💚 plus more good","summary":"Hi everyone! We're so excited to share that Toymaker: Threads of Joy 🪡🧸 has received the Projects We Love badge from Kickstarter 🫶, a show of support and enthusiasm from the Kickstarter team! Wait, you didn't know we're launching a Kickstarter campaign? Well, now you do! Don't miss the chance to back Early Bird tiers and exclusive limited physical rewards when the campaign launches in March by clicking the Notify Me button 🟢 👉https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/uprisingstudios/toymaker-craft-pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-18T18:11:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633183182","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1811772772474391","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"Toymaker will be playable at the BCNGameFest 10-12 October","summary":"Toymaker will be playable during the BCNGameFest, In Barcelona (Spain) between 10-12 October.We will be showing the game and a demo will be playable during the event.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-02T11:51:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772474391","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-1811772772369598","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"Toymaker has a new trailer!","summary":"We are really happy to show the new trailer for Toymaker!Please let us know what you think!! We believe it showcases the progress that we're making with the game :)We hope you like it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-29T09:47:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772369598","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2968270-6148070194801657001","game_id":"steam-2968270","kind":"announcement","title":"Toymaker is on Steam!","summary":"Hi everyone! We are really happy to anounce that the Steam page for Toymaker is live! You can wishlist the game here: Steam Page WHAT IS TOYMAKER Toymaker is a crafting game with an interesting story, set in the 1910s in Spain, based on a folk story. The player has to create cute plushies and sell them in their shop, inherited when their mom disappeared. We hope you like the game and if you do... add it to your wishlist! And leave us a comment if you want :) Love, Celer","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-11-09T10:07:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6148070194801657001","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2968270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:48Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:47Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2968270":"2026-10-26T10:14:48Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2968270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:47Z"},"4426900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:48Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2968270","app_id":2968270,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_siz